			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Compact multi-line async method signature\n\nReformat the `RefreshTreeView` method implementation in `FileExplorerViewProvider.rs` from a multi-line parameter list to a single line. This aligns with the project's strict formatting conventions and recent refactor efforts to reduce vertical whitespace in Rust source files without altering functional behavior.\n\nThe change improves code density and maintains consistency with the compact style applied to other build and provider modules.",
			"SHA": "4f4f4afcb39eb9493bfd8dad5a215912cd6f87ae"
		},
