				6
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align IPC command imports and redirect to legacy server\n\nStandardize import paths across `Source/Binary/IPC/` modules to enforce explicit `::Fn` call paths for nested functions and align with the recent entry-point refactoring guidelines. Update `MessageReceiveCommand` and `StatusGetCommand` to redirect IPC handling calls from `TauriIPCServer` to `TauriIPCServer_Old`, ensuring compatibility with the current legacy server instance while the new implementation stabilizes.\n\nAdditionally, resolve import ambiguity in `WorkbenchConfigurationCommand` and `WorkspaceFolderCommand` by using the full nested path `ApplicationState::State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState`. Consolidate `mod.rs` to remove unnecessary comments and maintain clean module boundaries for the IPC surface exposed to Sky/Wind.\n\nThese changes ensure strict adherence to the `Struct::Struct` naming convention, reduce module resolution ambiguity, and maintain IPC continuity during the architecture migration.",
			"SHA": "3bb63be8bab077bd0db7baa4cc9ab88afbb09a43"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T06:36:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1128,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align IPC client calls and import paths\n\nStandardize invocation of IPC client methods by appending `::Fn` to `Client::SendRequest` and `Client::SendNotification` across `CommandProvider`, `IPCProvider`, and `FileWatcherProvider`. This aligns with the project's strict `Struct` naming convention and recent entry-point refactors requiring explicit call paths.\n\nAdditionally, update `MountainEnvironment` imports to use the full nested path `State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` for clarity, and remove convenience re-exports from `mod.rs` to enforce direct type imports. These changes ensure consistency with the codebase's architectural guidelines and reduce ambiguity in module resolution.",
			"SHA": "4c40466007b23801abdfca776e2804f04378117a"
		}
